徵靈圉而選之兮，部乘眾神於瑤光。使五帝先導兮，反太一而從陵陽。左玄冥而右含靁兮，前陸離而後潏湟。厮征北僑而役羡門兮，屬岐伯使尚方。祝融驚而蹕御兮，清氛氣而後行。屯余車其萬乘兮，綷雲蓋而樹華旗。使勾芒其將行兮，吾欲往乎南嬉。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"真人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"靈圉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"眾神","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"五帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"本句神帝群稱，不指定五個世系人物；五畤與古注轉報五時分存。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"太一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"陵陽","kind":"person","person_id":"i4v_y28_wx0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"古注明稱仙人陵陽子明，與陽子古注所述陽陵子不能倒字合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"玄冥","kind":"person","person_id":"dal_xne_xt3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"古注稱北方黑帝之佐，只記神話身份，不補官爵任期或與其他祖系相接。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"含靁","kind":"person","person_id":"21k_m7f_sxc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本篇含靁依所引注為黔嬴，造化神與水神兩說分存；不改原字，不將外部用字冒作本文別名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"陸離","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"本篇陸離與漢書長離的神名／靈鳥解釋分存，未改字或強接個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"潏湟","kind":"person","person_id":"oj8_zfy_dkl","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本篇潏湟依注為神名；漢書矞皇用字另存，不先作跨見證別名定論。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"北僑"